source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: An even backslash run before the closing `??` kills the candidate exactly as an odd one does, so Jira finds no closer and renders the line literally; jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
??ab\\\\??
-- rendered.html --
<p>??ab\\\\??</p>
-- want.md --
??ab\\\\\\\\??
-- warnings.json --
[]
